<v><b>B:</b></v> In Manchester.

00:00:04.414 --> 00:00:05.903
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>How long have</b> you <b>lived</b> there?

00:00:06.277 --> 00:00:08.598
<v><b>B:</b></v> I<b>’ve lived</b> there <b>for</b> 20 years.

00:00:10.516 --> 00:00:12.383
Where does your sister work?

00:00:12.786 --> 00:00:14.534
<v><b>A:</b></v> In a primary school.

00:00:15.404 --> 00:00:17.224
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>How long has</b> she <b>worked</b> there?

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:20.273
<v><b>A:</b></v> She’s <b>worked</b> there <b>since</b> 2015.